{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AUGA4wjoZiHaKB29y5TGUw","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 review form scoring criteria acceptance rate\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Survey - Speaker Deck\",\"url\":\"https://speakerdeck.com/harukiabe/corl-2025-survey\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150\"},{\"title\":\"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer agreement trends from four years of electronic submissions of conference abstract\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1473196/\"},{\"title\":\"ReviewerToo: Should AI Join The Program Committee? A Look At The Future of Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.08867\"},{\"title\":\"Can LLM feedback enhance review quality? A randomized study of 20K   reviews at ICLR 2025\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.09737\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found limited specific information directly about CoRL 2025's review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate. The search results primarily returned information about other conferences (ICLR) and general peer review studies, rather than CoRL (Conference on Robot Learning) 2025 specific details.\n\nFrom the available results, I can see that CoRL 2025 includes information on participation scale and acceptance, but the specific scoring criteria and acceptance rate figures are not detailed in these search results.\n\nTo find the specific review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate for CoRL 2025, you would likely need to:\n- Check the official CoRL 2025 conference website\n- Review the call for papers or review guidelines posted by the conference organizers\n- Look at OpenReview.net, which is commonly used by conferences in this field for managing submissions and reviews\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific information about CoRL 2025, such as the official conference website or call for papers?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3f75ff7-cbcf-4297-8f4a-a59d253e665c","uuid":"e46293c5-c23d-48f9-b85b-d87505531cc0","timestamp":"2026-05-25T06:09:30.040Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2025 review form scoring criteria acceptance rate","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01UPDNxkiGDiGxdaXY1uBcMZ","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2025 Survey - Speaker Deck","url":"https://speakerdeck.com/harukiabe/corl-2025-survey"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/"},{"title":"The AI Review Lottery: Widespread AI-Assisted Peer Reviews Boost Paper   Scores and Acceptance Rates","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.02150"},{"title":"What Drives Paper Acceptance? A Process-Centric Analysis of Modern Peer Review","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.25701"},{"title":"Reviewer agreement trends from four years of electronic submissions of conference abstract","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1473196/"},{"title":"ReviewerToo: Should AI Join The Program Committee? A Look At The Future of Peer Review","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.08867"},{"title":"Can LLM feedback enhance review quality? A randomized study of 20K   reviews at ICLR 2025","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.09737"}]},"Based on the search results, I found limited specific information directly about CoRL 2025's review form scoring criteria and acceptance rate. The search results primarily returned information about other conferences (ICLR) and general peer review studies, rather than CoRL (Conference 