{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NHBnye9UA7WBjY1okNnGjM","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Robot Learning Foundation\",\"url\":\"https://www.robot-learning.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for Reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about CoRL 2026, though specific detailed reviewer guidelines and review form information for 2026 were not fully available in the results. Here's what I found:\n\n## CoRL 2026 Reviewer Information\n\nAll submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer, qualified if they have at least one accepted publication at a previous robotics (CoRL/ICRA/IROS/RSS) or learning conference (ICLR/NeurIPS/ICML) or equivalent journal.\n\nAdditionally, every author with 3 or more submissions must agree to serve as a reviewer.\n\n## Review Evaluation Criteria\n\nBased on the most recent available reviewer guidelines from CoRL 2024, reviews evaluate papers on:\n\nSubmissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical. All CoRL submissions must demonstrate the relevance to Robot Learning through Intent (explicitly address a learning question for physical robots) OR Outcome (test the proposed learning solution on physical robots).\n\n## Submission Platform\n\nPapers may be submitted through OpenReview via the link at https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference.\n\nFor the complete and most detailed CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form specifications, I recommend checking the OpenReview platform directly or the main CoRL 2026 website, as the search results didn't return a dedicated 2026 reviewer guidelines page with the specific review form template.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3f75ff7-cbcf-4297-8f4a-a59d253e665c","uuid":"498e204d-eb64-4b2c-8a1e-2e5d1a324c75","timestamp":"2026-05-25T06:09:30.279Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Pagh7akKvN1wnLoVD5nqgj","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"Robot Learning Foundation","url":"https://www.robot-learning.org/"},{"title":"CoRL 2026","url":"https://www.corl.org/"},{"title":"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/con