{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ELwsHpZwAJFgg4LYvUUCZQ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# importance_margin_vla_compress — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-25 05:45 UTC | 更新原因: 修正 ETA（Long ~21:00 UTC），westd-41074 仍空闲 Agent 正在部署，记录错误模型问题 M105\\\\n\\\\n> 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA vision token compressibility: **scoring method × connector × task 三维交互**。5+ 模型 × 4 LIBERO suites。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n🚨 **westd-41074**: 4 GPU 空闲，Agent 正在部署 OpenVLA Random k=0.9 Goal + Spatial（crossover 表唯一缺失）。⚠️ 之前部署使用了错误模型（M105），必须用 suite 对应微调模型。\\\\n🏃 **westd-38929**: 4 个 OpenVLA Long v3 实验 RUNNING（12:49 UTC 启动，Task 1/10）。**真实 ETA ~21:00 UTC**（非之前估的 13:00）。初步数据：Attn=50%, Random=64%, L2norm=72%。\\\\n🏃 **cqa1-33015**: 4 个 π0.5 cliff batch 在 torch.compile 阶段（正常）。\\\\n🏃 **westd-27271**: GPU 0 baseline Object s42 Task 7/10 (~2h)；GPU 1 Random Object s42 Task 4/10 (~3h)。\\\\n\\\\n## Deadlines\\\\n- **CoRL 2026 Abstract**: May 26 (~10h)\\\\n- **CoRL 2026 Paper**: May 29 (4 days)\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA (MLP) k=0.9 Crossover Table\\\\n| Suite | Baseline | Attn | L2norm | Random | Best |\\\\n|-------|----------|------|--------|--------|------|\\\\n| Object | 74.0% (s7⚠️) | 61.4% (-12.6pp) | 70.6% (-3.4pp) | 64.6% (-9.4pp)⚠️ | **L2norm** |\\\\n| Goal | 74.8% | 73.2% (-1.6pp) | **74.8%** (0pp) ✅ | 🚨 westd-41074 部署中 ~5h | **L2norm** |\\\\n| Spatial | 80.0% | **80.4%** (+0.4pp) ✅ | 75.0% (-5pp) | 🚨 westd-41074 部署中 ~5h | **Attn** |\\\\n| Long | 52.8% | 🏃 ~21:00 UTC (T1=50%) | 🏃 ~21:00 UTC (T1=72%) | 🏃 ~21:00 UTC (T1=64%) | TBD |\\\\n\\\\n### 2×2 Crossover\\\\n| | Attention | L2 norm |\\\\n|---|---------|---------|\\\\n| **Entangling (X-VLA)** | ✅ Long +60pp | ❌ aggressive k: -28pp |\\\\n| **MLP (OpenVLA)** | Spatial ✅ lossless; Goal -1.6pp